{"seq":2,"slug":"compute-cost-accounting","title":"RLVR 的算力账本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/practice-frontier/compute-cost-accounting","wordCount":1903,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"rlvr-的算力账本\">RLVR 的算力账本</h1><p>RLVR 的账单有一个反直觉的结构：钱的大头不在训练，而在「等模型把答案想完」。一条上万 token 的思考链要逐个解码出来；GRPO 还要把同一道题复制成组、每条链都完整生成。理解这本账目的科目划分与杠杆位置，是在有限预算内把 RLVR 做成的第一步——也是判断「别人家的结果我能不能复现」的先决条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RLVR 的训练成本有一个反直觉结构：大头不在策略更新，而在「等模型把答案想完」。一本可算的账目把开销拆成三个科目，杠杆也正落在科目之间的联动上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>采样科目</strong>：一个训练步的生成量是三因子乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{step}} = B \\times G \\times \\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，组大小与长思考链同时推高它，且自回归解码受显存带宽约束。</li>\n<li><strong>长度动态</strong>：平均长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随训练自我膨胀（想得越久答得越对），使成本随进程超线性上升，并逼出「最大长度设松还是设紧」的截断权衡。</li>\n<li><strong>墙钟科目</strong>：同步循环里训练集群空转等待最慢的长链，异步化把等待换成吞吐，代价是陈旧样本偏差。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读这本账要避免一个误区：按传统 SFT 经验折算 RLVR 预算会差出几倍，因为采样阶段的开销数倍于更新本身，且长度通胀与无效梯度组是两条持续的隐性浪费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"科目一-采样是绝对大头\">科目一：采样是绝对大头</h2><p>一个 GRPO 训练步消耗的生成量可以写成三因子乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{step}} = B \\times G \\times \\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是提示批大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是组大小（每组候选回答数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平均生成长度。RLVR 同时推高这三个因子：为撑住组内相对优势，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 8 到 16 甚至更高；长思考链把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从几百 token 推到数千乃至上万；而<a href=\"../paradigm/landmark-results\">标志性结果</a>篇里那条能力曲线，正是用天文数字级的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 累积出来的。更麻烦的是解码的计算性质：自回归生成受显存带宽约束，KV 缓存随序列长度线性膨胀、随并发生命周期叠加，长思考链让推理引擎的有效吞吐远低于短文本场景。粗略地说，RLVR 训练中采样阶段的计算开销数倍于策略更新本身，预算规划若按传统 SFT 经验折算会差出几倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"科目二-长度在训练中自我膨胀\">科目二：长度在训练中自我膨胀</h2><p>账本还有一个动态项：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是常数。R1-Zero 的训练记录显示回答长度随强化学习推进持续增长——模型发现想得越久答得越对。这对账本意味着每个训练步都比上一步更贵，成本随训练进程超线性上升；同时催生截断决策：最大生成长度设太松，尾部样本拖垮吞吐；设太紧，被截断的回答一律判零，奖励信号被截断噪声污染。DAPO 的超限塑形就是针对这一权衡的算法侧修补（见 <a href=\"../technical-stack/grpo-family\">GRPO 家族</a>），工程侧则要在预算表里给「长度通胀」单列一行预留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"科目三-同步等待与墙钟\">科目三：同步等待与墙钟</h2><p>第三本科目按墙钟而非 FLOPs 记账。同步循环里，训练集群必须等最慢的一批长链生成完毕才能更新——GPU 在两种状态间反复横跳：满载训练与空转等待。异步系统直接攻这个科目：AReaL 把生成与训练解耦后，等待时间转化为吞吐（架构见<a href=\"open-recipes\">开源配方</a>）。另一个容易被忽略的浪费科目是无效梯度组：通过率接近 0 或 1 的组不产生任何有效优势，算力照付。动态采样过滤重采能把这些浪费换成有效梯度，但重采本身也是开销——净收益取决于当前任务难度分布离中间地带有多远。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一次运行的示例账目\">一次运行的示例账目</h2><p>把公式代进一组示例量级（演示记账方法，非任何真实系统的实测值）：取批大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = 256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>、组大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>、平均长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>8000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L} = 8000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span></span></span></span></span> token，单个训练步的生成量就是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8000</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mtext> token</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{step}} = 256 \\times 16 \\times 8000 \\approx 3.3 \\times 10^{7} \\text{ token}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> token</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三千多万 token 的解码量，只是「一步」。再叠加显存侧的约束：KV 缓存占用近似为层数、KV 头数、头维度的乘积乘以序列长度再翻倍（K 与 V 各一份），长思考链直接决定了单卡能并发多少条生成——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从两千涨到八千，同样的显存只装得下四分之一的并发，吞吐随之塌缩。这本账解释了为什么 RLVR 实践中推理引擎的选型与调优（页式缓存管理、连续批处理）对训练成本的影响不亚于算法本身。也解释了动态采样省钱的真正路径：过滤掉无效组后，同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里有效梯度的占比提高，等价于单位算力的「汇率」升值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"杠杆清单\">杠杆清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杠杆</th>\n<th>省的是什么</th>\n<th>代价与风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>降低组大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>直接砍采样量</td>\n<td>优势估计方差变大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态采样</td>\n<td>无效组的算力</td>\n<td>重采开销，需监控难度漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收紧最大长度</td>\n<td>解码时长与 KV 显存</td>\n<td>截断噪声伤奖励信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>课程聚焦中间难度</td>\n<td>提高单位算力的有效梯度率</td>\n<td>出题与筛选本身有成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步化</td>\n<td>墙钟等待</td>\n<td>陈旧样本偏差、调试复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒸馏替代 RL</td>\n<td>全部 RL 开销</td>\n<td>天花板低于充分 RL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    BUD[&quot;每训练步总预算&quot;] --&gt; GEN[&quot;采样科目&lt;br/&gt;B × G × L 三因子&quot;]&#10;    BUD --&gt; TRN[&quot;训练科目&lt;br/&gt;前向 + 反向传播&quot;]&#10;    BUD --&gt; VER[&quot;验证科目&lt;br/&gt;执行沙箱 / 判定服务&quot;]&#10;    BUD --&gt; IDLE[&quot;同步等待&lt;br/&gt;可压缩至近零&quot;]&#10;    GEN --&gt;|&quot;课程聚焦&quot;| EFF[&quot;有效梯度率提升&quot;]&#10;    IDLE --&gt;|&quot;异步化&quot;| THR[&quot;墙钟吞吐提升&quot;]&#10;    EFF --&gt; OUT[&quot;同等预算下&lt;br/&gt;更多有效能力增量&quot;]&#10;    THR --&gt; OUT\">flowchart TD\n    BUD[\"每训练步总预算\"] --&gt; GEN[\"采样科目&lt;br/&gt;B × G × L 三因子\"]\n    BUD --&gt; TRN[\"训练科目&lt;br/&gt;前向 + 反向传播\"]\n    BUD --&gt; VER[\"验证科目&lt;br/&gt;执行沙箱 / 判定服务\"]\n    BUD --&gt; IDLE[\"同步等待&lt;br/&gt;可压缩至近零\"]\n    GEN --&gt;|\"课程聚焦\"| EFF[\"有效梯度率提升\"]\n    IDLE --&gt;|\"异步化\"| THR[\"墙钟吞吐提升\"]\n    EFF --&gt; OUT[\"同等预算下&lt;br/&gt;更多有效能力增量\"]\n    THR --&gt; OUT</pre><p>杠杆之间还有联动：课程聚焦提高有效梯度率（其倒 U 形原理见<a href=\"../domain-expansion/self-play-curricula\">自博弈与自动出题课程</a>），等于间接降低达到同样效果所需的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；而收紧长度惩罚除了省钱还顺带压制<a href=\"../technical-stack/reward-hacking-in-rlvr\">奖励黑客</a>里的长度黑客——好的成本杠杆常常一石二鸟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与蒸馏路线的对照核算\">与蒸馏路线的对照核算</h2><p>预算讨论绕不开那个尖锐的对照：s1 论文（arXiv:2501.19393）只用一千条精选推理轨迹微调 Qwen2.5-32B，云租费用不到五十美元就复现了接近 o1-preview 的数学表现；而 RLVR 训练动辄以万卡时计。但 R1 报告同样给出了另一半结论：蒸馏在小模型上效率惊人，可一旦模型够大、算力够多，强化学习的上限高于蒸馏——它创造新行为，蒸馏只搬运已有行为。理性的资源分配因此是个分段函数：小模型、快迭代、明确目标用蒸馏；冲能力边界用 RLVR；两者串联（RL 训大模型再蒸馏给小模型）则是当前开源生态的标准打法，Tulu 3 式的后训练集成（见<a href=\"open-recipes\">开源配方</a>）展示了如何在常规管线里给 RLVR 划定一块性价比合理的地盘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>RLVR 的账本由三个科目构成：采样主导的生成开销、随训练自我膨胀的长度动态、同步循环里的墙钟等待。主要杠杆——组大小、动态采样、长度管理、课程聚焦、异步化——分别作用在不同科目上且互有联动。与蒸馏的分界线清晰：五十美元级预算选蒸馏，冲击上限才值得开 RLVR 的账。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RLVR 的算力账本","id":"rlvr-的算力账本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"科目一：采样是绝对大头","id":"科目一-采样是绝对大头"},{"level":2,"text":"科目二：长度在训练中自我膨胀","id":"科目二-长度在训练中自我膨胀"},{"level":2,"text":"科目三：同步等待与墙钟","id":"科目三-同步等待与墙钟"},{"level":2,"text":"一次运行的示例账目","id":"一次运行的示例账目"},{"level":2,"text":"杠杆清单","id":"杠杆清单"},{"level":2,"text":"与蒸馏路线的对照核算","id":"与蒸馏路线的对照核算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开源配方：open-r1、verl 与 AReaL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/practice-frontier/open-recipes"},"next":{"title":"开放问题：泛化、多样性退化与对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/practice-frontier/open-problems"}}